                  "evidence": "explorer/assets/explorer.css:100\u2013104 defines a grid of bordered cards without connectors. The only connector rule, `.flow li + li::before`, is inside the `max-width: 52rem` media query at lines 112\u2013118, so wider viewports have no arrows or connecting lines. design.md decision 2 describes the overview as connected steps.",
